      "start_seconds": 248.57,
      "end_seconds": 263.06,
      "duration_seconds": 14.49,
      "text": "Putting together what you've described, I think we're dealing with an enlarged gland with night sweats that needs a proper work-up at this stage. We shouldn't forget a blood condition."
