      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.01,
      "end_seconds": 293.97,
      "duration_seconds": 25.96,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's an enlarged gland with night sweats that needs a proper work-up, and we'll know more once the a chest X-ray is back. I'd like to arrange a chest X-ray for night sweats. I think blood tests makes sense here, for night sweats. Keep a note of your temperature each evening"
